  "description": "Basic doesn't have to skimp on comfort, and simple doesn't mean devoid of features. The feature-laden LXI Flow 1 combines ultimate comfort with ultimate affordability. An upright, see the cars and have the cars see you posture, suspension seatpost, and straightforward 7-speed-twist shifter make riding a bike as simple as... riding a bike.\nUpright ride positioning provides excellent visibility, comfort, and easy on/off the bike transitions\nMid-range, 1x7 drivetrain with twist shifter provides simple, easy shifting\nAffordable price point keeps comfort within reach\nRelaxed headtube angle provides more predictable and steady steering with nothing sneaking up on you\nRelaxed seat tube angle brings the rider position less over the bars and more evenly positioned, with better posture",
